        "證明：先證 $\\dfrac{d}{dt}F(z(t))=F'(z(t))\\,z'(t)$。",
        "$F$ 在 $w_0=z(t)$ 可微：$F(w)-F(w_0)=\\big(F'(w_0)+\\eta(w)\\big)(w-w_0)$，$\\eta(w)\\to0$",
        "$\\eta(w)=\\frac{F(w)-F(w_0)}{w-w_0}-F'(w_0)$（$w\\ne w_0$），$\\eta(w_0)=0$",
