        "\\begin{aligned}\\Big|\\int_Cf\\,dz\\Big|&\\le\\int_a^b|f(z(t))|\\,|z'(t)|\\,dt\\\\&\\le M\\!\\int_a^b|z'(t)|\\,dt=ML\\quad\\blacksquare\\end{aligned}"
